# pnpm hoisted layout — required for Expo Metro bundler to resolve packages
# like react-native-css-interop, expo-modules-core, etc. that only appear as
# transitive deps. Without this, the EAS build's Metro phase fails with
# "Unable to resolve module ..." for symlink-isolated transitive deps.
# Reference: https://docs.expo.dev/guides/monorepos/#solving-issues-with-isolated-modules-in-pnpm
node-linker=hoisted
